  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and juice lemons into a blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel garlic; add to the blender along with cashews, water, nutritional yeast, capers, soy sauce, Dijon, salt, and pepper. Blend on high, adding additional water, 1-2 tablespoons at a time, if needed, to make a smooth dip."
